  "description": "这里是我个人对跑步受伤的看法：几乎所有跑步受伤的人，都是因为长跑。他们把马拉松或者铁人三项作为最高标准和荣誉。",
  "body_html": "<p><span>这里是我个人对跑步受伤的看法：几乎所有跑步受伤的人，都是因为长跑。他们把马拉松或者铁人三项作为最高标准和荣誉。</span></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nk7-!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F644a4c7d-53d7-4562-b973-c04be0eeb208_1920x1080.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nk7-!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F644a4c7d-53d7-4562-b973-c04be0eeb208_1920x1080.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nk7-!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F644a4c7d-53d7-4562-b973-c04be0eeb208_1920x1080.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nk7-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F644a4c7d-53d7-4562-b973-c04be0eeb208_1920x1080.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nk7-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F644a4c7d-53d7-4562-b973-c04be0eeb208_1920x1080.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nk7-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F644a4c7d-53d7-4562-b973-c04be0eeb208_1920x1080.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"819\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/644a4c7d-53d7-4562-b973-c04be0eeb208_1920x1080.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:819,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:285736,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://yinwang1.substack.com/i/210177958?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F644a4c7d-53d7-4562-b973-c04be0eeb208_1920x1080.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nk7-!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F644a4c7d-53d7-4562-b973-c04be0eeb208_1920x1080.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nk7-!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F644a4c7d-53d7-4562-b973-c04be0eeb208_1920x1080.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nk7-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F644a4c7d-53d7-4562-b973-c04be0eeb208_1920x1080.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Nk7-!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F644a4c7d-53d7-4562-b973-c04be0eeb208_1920x1080.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>对于我来说，马拉松和铁人三项这类运动，似乎是故意设计来害人的。特别是铁人三项，这名字就是错的。人当然不是铁做的。</p><p>人的身体不是设计来跑这么远的。这样的连续奔跑，马都可能累死，更不要说人了。</p><p>你要跟马一比高低吗？那干嘛不跟汽车，火车比一比呢？你不是铁人吗？</p><p>很多跑马拉松受伤的，都是因为“过度使用”。要明白人是血肉之躯，这样长时间的反复冲击和用力，当然容易弄出问题来。</p><p>马拉松为什么叫马拉松？因为：</p><blockquote><p>公元前490年，雅典军队在雅典东北的马拉松平原击退波斯入侵军。传令兵菲迪皮茨（Pheidippides）从战场一路跑回雅典传递胜利喜讯，抵达后体力耗尽离世。1896年第一届现代奥林匹克运动会设立该长跑项目，以“马…</p></blockquote>",
